flowchart LR
  A[Raw clickstream CSVs\npublic GCS or BYO] --> B[to_parquet\nclean + partition]
  B --> C[build_features\nsession features + labels]
  C --> D[train\nSpark MLlib logreg]
  D --> E[evaluate\nmetrics + plots]
  E --> F[export_dashboard_data\nJSON + parquet]
  F --> G[Streamlit dashboard]

  subgraph Storage
    S1[data/processed\nparquet]:::store
    S2[models/logreg]:::store
    S3[reports/\nmetrics + figures]:::store
  end

  B --> S1
  C --> S1
  D --> S2
  E --> S3
  F --> S3

  subgraph Execution
    X1[Local Spark]\n    X2[Dataproc Serverless]
  end

  A -. config.gcp.yaml .-> X2
  A -. config.yaml .-> X1
  X1 --> B
  X2 --> B

  classDef store fill:#0f172a,stroke:#38bdf8,color:#e2e8f0
